    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sordesco</span></b> , dŭi, 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[sordeo], <i>to become dirty</i>, <i>grow
				filthy</i> (not ante-Aug., and very rare): contrectatus ubi
			manibus sordescere vulgi Coeperis (liber), *
					<i><span class="en">Hor. Ep 1</span></i>, 
			 20, 11: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mel,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 12, 12, § 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					33, 3, 19, § 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to become wild</i>, <i>lie untilled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					4, 12, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to be mean</i>, <i>vile</i>, <i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 13,
			2</span></i>.</div>
